[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Video2X needs a GPU with a working Vulkan driver (for example
graphics/mesa-dri or the NVIDIA driver). List the usable devices with:

  video2x --list-devices

The libplacebo (Anime4K) processor uses FFmpeg's libplacebo filter, so
multimedia/ffmpeg has to be built with the LIBPLACEBO and VULKAN options
(both are on by default).

Models are installed in %%DATADIR%%/models.
EOM
}
]
